WEBVTT

1
00:00:01.260 --> 00:00:07.259
In this class, you have learned how to export your Twinmotion project to Unreal Engine for further processing.

2
00:00:07.259 --> 00:00:16.079
You've experimented in recommended workflows, and learned a few tips and tricks to ensure the best compatibility between Twinmotion and Unreal Engine.

3
00:00:16.079 --> 00:00:22.320
You learned how to set the stage, and what plugins you need to help with the transfer.

4
00:00:22.320 --> 00:00:32.109
You learned to ingest the Twinmotion data into Unreal Engine in a couple of different ways, how to manage lights, levels of detail and collisions,

5
00:00:32.109 --> 00:00:36.799
and finally how to fix or replace those effects that didn't transfer properly.

6
00:00:36.799 --> 00:00:40.719
I hope you enjoyed this class and hope to be with you again soon.
